THIRD-PARTY ASSETS

This skill ships no third-party media. `scripts/setup_assets.py` fetches or
generates everything at install time:

  Fonts    Heebo, Roboto Slab, Inter and any other face in scripts/fonts.py,
           downloaded from the Google Fonts repository under the SIL Open Font
           License 1.1 / Apache 2.0. Not redistributed as part of this package.
           The skill refuses any font without a verified free licence.

  SFX      Synthesised from scratch by scripts/setup_assets.py. No third-party
           audio is included, and nothing is sampled from any library.

  Flares   Generated procedurally by scripts/setup_assets.py.

  GSAP     Downloaded at setup time from a public CDN. GSAP is distributed by
           Webflow under its own licence; review it for your use case at
           https://gsap.com/licensing/ — it is not covered by the MIT licence
           above and is not redistributed here.

Parts of the working method and two helper scripts (pack_transcript.py,
timeline_view.py) are adapted from browser-use/video-use, MIT licence,
Copyright (c) 2026 Browser Use. Its licence text is in third_party/video-use/LICENSE.

Music is never bundled. Point `audio.music_dir` in your config.json at a library
you are licensed to use.
